        "start_xml_ordinal": 10152,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 476,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 142,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "The values of the tangential stresses at the free surface  due to wind can be described using suitable expressions to capture the large scale influence of the wind. Notice that local generation of wind waves is not included."
      },
      {
        "container_path": "_staging/total-read/model-audit/XBeach/connectivity/nonhydro-read/body-field-recovery/body-cached.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 10197,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 478,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 144,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "At the bottom the kinematic boundary condition (1.8) is used to enforce the normal component of the flow. The two tangential stresses due to bottom friction are specified using an expression based on the mean flow of the form of"
